  - EXOS-91
    * Add Redeploy of snmp access-profile functionality when the referenced
    access-list is modified. This means that when an ACL is modified, the
    referenced snmp access-profile is first deleted, then the acl is deleted,
    followed by the recreate of the updated acl and finally putting back the
    removed snmp access-profile
     (EXOS-91 / BEMS01735668 / SR-697105524)

