extreme-xos v1.5 [2023-09-22]
================================================================================
Changes that might affect a package upgrade from version 1.4:
  NOTE: The below YANG model changes are not backwards compatible:

  Incompatible nodes:
  /configure/netlogin/add/mac-list/ports


Corrections:

  - Fix missing dependency order between //configure vlan * add ports * and //enable ip-security dhcp-snooping vlan * ports *
     (EXOS-87 / BSP-3494 / BEMS01644260)

  - Change element type from leaf-list to leaf for /configure/netlogin/add/mac-list */ports as leaf-list functionality is not 
    compatible with the device, and due to its presence, NSO tries to add/delete elements to the ports (not possible in the device), 
    causing incorrect configuration commands.
     (EXOS-88 / BSP-3495 / BEMS01644441)

