extreme-xos v1.0.2 [2021-03-04]
================================================================================

Corrections:

  - add fix for correct banner ingestion
     (EXOS-30 / PS-40479 / RT45365)


Enhancements:

  - Add support for cleartext provisioning by default.
    This means that service/user encrypted strings (type
    tailf:aes-cfb-128-encrypted-string) can be passed to the Ned, that will
    automatically decrypt values before sending it to the device as clear text
    (without 'encrypted' tag, tag will be autoremoved from the configuration
    line)
     (EXOS-31 / PS-40480 / RT45366)

YANG model changes since 1.0.1:

  Changed nodes:
  /create/account/encrypted


